Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 50,0:01:53.34,0:01:56.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What? They ran\Naway and left the island?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:56.71,0:01:57.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:57.79,0:02:00.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We couldn't even give them our gift.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:00.05,0:02:01.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How disappointing.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:02.76,0:02:04.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And after all they did for us.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:04.51,0:02:07.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wonder if they realize how\Nmuch we appreciate them.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:09.66,0:02:11.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:11.12,0:02:12.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They don't know how we feel.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:16.96,0:02:19.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know, Aisa, it's not fair\Nthat you were the only one
Dialogue: 50,0:02:19.25,0:02:21.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that got to say goodbye to them.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:21.17,0:02:24.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everyone's really upset that we\Nlet our heroes just run away.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:32.23,0:02:34.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy can stretch his body really far!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:34.98,0:02:37.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's like a "Gum-Gum Pistol!"\NKapow! Yay!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:37.90,0:02:40.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aisa, please! You've got to hold still!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:40.74,0:02:44.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I never knew there were warriors\Nlike him in the Blue Sea!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:44.28,0:02:46.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wanna be just\Nlike him when I grow up.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:46.62,0:02:48.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A Gum-Gum warrior!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:49.61,0:02:51.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aisa.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:51.58,0:02:52.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:52.72,0:02:54.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm just going to\Ntrim your hair a little.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:54.63,0:02:56.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You need to let it grow.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:56.51,0:02:57.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:57.26,0:02:58.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, it'll look good.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:58.96,0:03:01.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think you've forgotten you're\Na girl, and girls should look cute.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:01.88,0:03:04.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What? Cute? Me?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:04.76,0:03:06.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you nuts?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:06.77,0:03:08.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:09.04,0:03:12.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}With the war over, there's no need for\Nkids like you to carry weapons anymore.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:14.77,0:03:21.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Now you can enjoy life the way it was\Nmeant to be and as a proper young lady.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:21.09,0:03:23.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I never knew you were so ladylike!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:24.93,0:03:27.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come on, Aisa! Now hold still!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.10,0:03:28.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Laki's ladylike!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:28.31,0:03:29.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aisa!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:37.20,0:03:38.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Great Warrior Kalgara.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:39.87,0:03:43.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We were told that the Shandorians'\Nrole has been fulfilled.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:43.97,0:03:48.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As for your last wish it was\Ndelivered to your best friend.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:48.93,0:03:52.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Our future generations will\Nno longer have to shed blood.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:52.73,0:03:55.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We are finally at peace.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:55.15,0:03:56.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The war may be over.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:56.73,0:03:59.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But one thing that will\Nnever end is our pride!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.28,0:04:03.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please continue to guide us, Mighty\NKalgara, and watch over us as well.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:05.28,0:04:09.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We solemnly swear, The Fire\Nof Shandora will never die!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:19.89,0:04:21.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I-I cannot abandon my duties!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:21.93,0:04:23.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am the Sky Knight, after all.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:24.27,0:04:26.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you should\Nbe looking at yourself.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:26.61,0:04:29.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Remember, this city originally\Nbelonged to your people.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.74,0:04:31.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It did, long ago.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:31.70,0:04:33.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But that means nothing now.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:33.91,0:04:37.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In fact, with this battle, all\Nof us realized something.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:37.16,0:04:39.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vearth belongs to no group.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:39.04,0:04:40.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It must be shared.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:40.99,0:04:43.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Our world has two sides.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:43.36,0:04:45.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The land is called Skypiea.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:45.40,0:04:47.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The city, Shandora.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:47.48,0:04:50.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They have been torn\Nasunder by war for ages.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:50.44,0:04:55.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Only a man who has long lamented that\Nwar can unite them, and that man is you.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:57.07,0:04:59.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So Sky Knight, Gan Fall.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:59.66,0:05:02.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'd like you to take\NSkypiea's throne again.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:02.61,0:05:07.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Only you can heal the deep wounds\Nthat scar this land of ours.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.91,0:05:09.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'd like you to do it, too, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:09.46,0:05:10.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gan Fall, please!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:10.76,0:05:14.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We Shandorians are behind\Nyou all the way Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:14.30,0:05:15.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gan Fall!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:15.80,0:05:16.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Our god!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:16.80,0:05:18.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please come back!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:21.53,0:05:23.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, well.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:23.58,0:05:26.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And here I was thinking\Nthat I'd finally be able
Dialogue: 50,0:05:26.09,0:05:29.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to get some rest and\Ntend to my pumpkin patch.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.83,0:05:57.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay! We're almost there!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.75,0:06:00.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everyone! See that up ahead?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:00.83,0:06:02.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's Cloud End!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:02.04,0:06:03.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa, lemme see!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:04.34,0:06:05.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:05.42,0:06:07.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So that's where we go back down from?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:07.30,0:06:09.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We got here sooner than I thought.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:11.27,0:06:13.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aww. We really have to go back already?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.18,0:06:17.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know, it sounds crazy, but I'm\Nactually gonna miss this place.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:17.98,0:06:20.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think it's time we said\Ngoodbye to the White Sea.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:20.58,0:06:22.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sky island sure is fun.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:22.75,0:06:24.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But scary, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:24.67,0:06:27.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}We just go through that gate,\Nand there'll be a Milky Road that'll take us
Dialogue: 50,0:06:27.38,0:06:29.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to the Blue Sea, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.88,0:06:32.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wonder if we'll ever\Nvisit this place again.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:32.26,0:06:34.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, you never know.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:43.42,0:06:46.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but this\Nis as far as we can go!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:46.22,0:06:47.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, my friends!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:47.47,0:06:49.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Take care of yourselves!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:49.51,0:06:50.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Suu!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:50.39,0:06:51.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We will! Thanks for the escort!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:51.97,0:06:54.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Conis! Don't forget me, angel!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:54.67,0:06:56.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye to the others for us!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:56.90,0:06:58.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:59.72,0:07:00.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was nice meeting you guys!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:00.97,0:07:02.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks for everything!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:02.89,0:07:05.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! You've got it wrong!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.25,0:07:08.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're the ones who\Nshould be thanking you!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:08.39,0:07:10.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll never forget you!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:10.01,0:07:11.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you all!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:11.43,0:07:13.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Conis, old guy, furball!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:13.44,0:07:14.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Take care now!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:14.94,0:07:16.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Bye!\N– Bye!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:16.11,0:07:17.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now take in your sails,\Nand hold on tight!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:17.96,0:07:19.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're in for a bumpy ride!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.88,0:07:22.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right! Let's do as the man says!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.42,0:07:24.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It feels like we're\Nalready picking up speed!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:24.42,0:07:28.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and we're sliding down from\Nthousands of feet in the air! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.22,0:07:29.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Aye!\N– Aye!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:29.22,0:07:31.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(377,1053)}{\q2}– Huh?\N– Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:35.02,0:07:36.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wh-What the...?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:38.33,0:07:40.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He says, "Don't leave without me."
Dialogue: 50,0:07:40.67,0:07:41.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:41.92,0:07:44.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's the Southbird we\Nbrought up here with us.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:47.71,0:07:51.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Captain! It looks like the log pose has\Nthe coordinates for the next island!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:53.93,0:07:55.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Great! Let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.64,0:07:58.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Once we get to the bottom, we're\Ngonna start a brand-new adventure!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:58.93,0:08:01.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who's up for finding some gold?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:01.03,0:08:03.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Guys! Get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.67,0:08:07.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}Blue Sea, here we come!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:07.90,0:08:09.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Aye!\N– Aye!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:22.08,0:08:24.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everyone grab hold of something!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:24.29,0:08:26.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The freefall's about to start!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:38.53,0:08:40.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heso!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:45.66,0:08:47.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just hang on!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:47.08,0:08:50.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,One Octopus Balloon, on the way!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:02.44,0:09:04.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Octopus!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:05.10,0:09:07.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:09.56,0:09:11.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh! Oh, that hurt.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:12.30,0:09:13.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What... happened?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.39,0:09:18.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys! Get a load of this!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:21.25,0:09:22.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the hell is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.75,0:09:24.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A balloon!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:25.32,0:09:27.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Ain't it great?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:27.12,0:09:28.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're not falling!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:28.50,0:09:29.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, good!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:29.79,0:09:32.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,For a minute there,\NI thought we were goners!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:32.04,0:09:33.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All of us!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:00.83,0:10:02.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Keep ringing it!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:02.48,0:10:07.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let the departing heroes of this land\Nknow how much we appreciate them!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:07.36,0:10:08.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heso!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:13.95,0:10:15.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're always welcome!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:15.66,0:10:17.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:17.16,0:10:19.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We wish you\Nsafe passage to the Blue Sea!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:27.92,0:10:31.25,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,When you look up, you see the sky.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:31.25,0:10:33.88,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,Though some believe\Nit to be only a legend,
Dialogue: 50,0:10:33.88,0:10:37.85,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,there is an island floating\Nthousands of feet in the air.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:37.85,0:10:42.60,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,If you listen carefully,\Nyou can hear the tolling of a bell.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:42.60,0:10:46.35,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,It rings today, and it\Nwill ring again tomorrow.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:46.35,0:10:51.65,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,That bell rings from the heavens,\Nfrom a land that wandered.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.65,0:10:54.24,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,It sings of its pride, and proclaims
Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.24,0:10:59.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to the rest of the world,\N"We are here."
Dialogue: 50,0:11:00.70,0:11:02.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is so great!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:02.25,0:11:03.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tell me about it!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:03.59,0:11:06.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What a way to travel! I love it!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.15,0:11:10.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're calling off the search?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:11.61,0:11:13.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:13.07,0:11:15.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The City of Gold has been\Nin the sky this whole time.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:15.11,0:11:17.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's nothing else to be\Nfound at the bottom of the sea.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:17.82,0:11:21.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sorry, fellas. This dream's over.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:21.19,0:11:23.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No point in staying here anymore.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:23.44,0:11:25.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Old man.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:25.11,0:11:27.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cricket.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:27.07,0:11:31.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I wanna thank all of you for helping me\Npursue my dream for all of these years.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:31.31,0:11:33.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You never stopped believing.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:33.39,0:11:34.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That means a lot.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:34.24,0:11:35.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Does this mean...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:35.46,0:11:37.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...you're leaving the Alliance?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:38.52,0:11:39.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:41.94,0:11:45.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Since this dream's done, which\None are we gonna pursue next?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:50.90,0:11:54.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll all follow you to\Nthe ends of the earth, Old Man!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:54.95,0:11:55.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:58.28,0:12:03.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Gold! Gold! Gold! Gold!\N– Gold! Gold! Gold! Gold!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:03.87,0:12:05.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We finally struck it rich!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:05.92,0:12:08.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What should we buy with all this loot?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:08.25,0:12:11.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! I know! A huge bronze statue!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:11.46,0:12:12.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Moron!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.76,0:12:14.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Only an idiot would\Nexchange gold for bronze!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:14.75,0:12:15.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How stupid!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.88,0:12:17.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What we need are more cannons!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:17.63,0:12:19.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ten of them! Ten!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:19.13,0:12:22.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami, I want to buy\Na refrigerator with a lock!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:22.02,0:12:23.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:23.31,0:12:26.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}If you get one with a lock, there'll be\Nno way for me to get a midnight snack!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:26.01,0:12:28.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}That's exactly why I want one, you pig!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:28.39,0:12:30.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Would you guys just hold on a second?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:30.81,0:12:32.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We need to land first.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:32.35,0:12:34.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then we can divide up the treasure.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:34.45,0:12:36.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please buy me books!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:36.82,0:12:41.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we buy everything you guys want,\Nwe're gonna be broke again in no time.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.08,0:12:43.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Miss Navigator?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.02,0:12:44.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The ship.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:44.06,0:12:46.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just where is it headed exactly?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:46.05,0:12:48.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where else? The next island, of course.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:53.25,0:12:54.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(455.5,1053)}– You okay?\N– What's wrong?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:54.53,0:12:57.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Need a hug, Nami?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:59.50,0:13:01.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:01.58,0:13:05.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We've been blown off course!\NWe must have hit an air current!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:05.42,0:13:06.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:06.42,0:13:08.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, I definitely feel a breeze.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:08.42,0:13:09.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that a bad thing?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:09.71,0:13:11.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Of course it is!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:11.21,0:13:14.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now we have no idea where we\Nare or where we're gonna land!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.51,0:13:18.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}And with the octopus up there,\Nwe can't set the sails or control the ship.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:18.72,0:13:20.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:20.05,0:13:21.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.59,0:13:25.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Once we touch down, we'll just head\Nto the next island, easy as that!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:25.14,0:13:28.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There you go, running\Noff at the mouth as always.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:28.04,0:13:30.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:30.01,0:13:32.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji, what is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.03,0:13:34.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nah. Guess I was wrong.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:34.79,0:13:37.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh? About what?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:37.02,0:13:39.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No. Never mind.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:39.27,0:13:41.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We've got a problem!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:45.62,0:13:47.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, it was just a dream.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:47.22,0:13:48.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks for scaring us!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:48.52,0:13:51.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna fillet you for that! I swear!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:03.24,0:14:05.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The sun's completely set now.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:05.62,0:14:07.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's still a nice view.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:08.11,0:14:10.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're right. It really is.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:13.75,0:14:16.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's all the ruckus out here?!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.41,0:14:17.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Make way!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:17.91,0:14:20.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Quit pushing! C'mon! Stop it! Lemme go!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:20.95,0:14:22.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why are they fighting?!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:34.90,0:14:36.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bellamy!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:36.02,0:14:37.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sarquiss!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:37.58,0:14:39.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Isn't someone gonna stop them?!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:40.65,0:14:43.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No more! I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:43.51,0:14:45.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why are you making me do this?!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:45.41,0:14:46.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:46.81,0:14:49.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've never seen\NSarquiss plead like that.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:49.62,0:14:51.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why you ask?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:51.39,0:14:55.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why am I making you? Sarquiss. Bellamy.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:57.67,0:15:04.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I'm making you do this because you've made\Na mockery of this symbol. Heh heh heh...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:04.55,0:15:07.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Does the Sky Island exist or not?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:07.80,0:15:11.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is the legendary\NCity of Gold real or not?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:13.64,0:15:16.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The truth doesn't\Nreally matter, now does it.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:16.54,0:15:21.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You play the opposing sides off each\Nother, to twist them to your will.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:21.06,0:15:24.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's what I told you. Right, Bellamy?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:25.86,0:15:29.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think that's, Don Quixote Doflamingo!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:29.12,0:15:31.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's one of\Nthe Seven Warlords of the Sea!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:31.79,0:15:34.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I heard his bounty's over 300 million.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:34.41,0:15:36.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's a guy like him doing here?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:36.69,0:15:41.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}You've really let me down and I've got\Nzero tolerance for useless punks like you.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:41.88,0:15:45.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! Not again! My body's moving,
Dialogue: 50,0:15:45.50,0:15:50.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,on its own, I can't\Ncontrol it! Please, nooooo!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:54.45,0:15:55.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(557,1053)}– Bellamy!\N– Bellamy!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:00.78,0:16:01.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:01.88,0:16:03.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:03.12,0:16:06.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just give me one more\Nchance, to set things right.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:06.49,0:16:10.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I swear we will loyally\Nfollow your every command.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:10.53,0:16:11.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bellamy!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:11.64,0:16:13.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let it go, Bellamy!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:15.78,0:16:19.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I might've lost but I have never\Nonce acted against your principles.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:19.39,0:16:21.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I swear on your symbol! Please!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:21.74,0:16:23.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I had reasons for my actions!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:23.85,0:16:26.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I couldn't just let the\NStraw Hats get away.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:26.06,0:16:29.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They were bound to find you\Nsomeday if I didn't stop them!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:29.90,0:16:32.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahhh... What a touching sentiment.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:32.54,0:16:34.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Such genuine loyalty.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:34.51,0:16:39.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your concern for my well-being\Nis duly noted, Bellamy.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:39.05,0:16:43.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh heh heh... There's a\NNew Era quickly approaching,
Dialogue: 50,0:16:43.22,0:16:46.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so your actions here\Nwon't really matter.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.12,0:16:56.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doflamingooo!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:02.00,0:17:07.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}He wiped out Bellamy as easily as stomping\Non a baby! He was worth 55 million!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:07.11,0:17:08.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hehehehe...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:08.71,0:17:10.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The beginning is upon us!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:10.88,0:17:14.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I suggest you prepare. We're\Ndrawing close to a new world
Dialogue: 50,0:17:14.16,0:17:17.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,in which only true pirates can survive.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:17.06,0:17:21.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}The weak should run while they still can,\Nor be swept away by the tides of time
Dialogue: 50,0:17:21.64,0:17:24.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,as they roll back to reveal\Na New Era of Champions!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:29.17,0:17:31.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is taking longer than I expected.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:31.93,0:17:33.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:33.30,0:17:35.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm really worried about\Nhow far we've drifted.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:35.47,0:17:36.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We could be anywhere.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:36.77,0:17:40.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What if I sang you girls a romantic\Nsong to take your mind off th...?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:40.02,0:17:41.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Buzz off!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:43.52,0:17:44.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:44.82,0:17:46.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I betcha we get blown\Nall the way to Raftel!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:48.66,0:17:49.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh, guys?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:49.87,0:17:51.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, that's impossible.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:51.87,0:17:55.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'd have to sail across more than\Nhalf the Grand Line just to get there.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:55.75,0:17:59.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh... Yeah, um, I knew that.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:59.52,0:18:02.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This conversation's boring.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:02.61,0:18:04.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How much longer is this gonna take?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:04.81,0:18:06.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go to sleep.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:06.52,0:18:07.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Zoro!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:07.99,0:18:11.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you're really bored, I've got\Nsomething you can do, and it's fun!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:11.84,0:18:13.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh? Luffy?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:13.47,0:18:15.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where'd his voice come from?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.14,0:18:17.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good question.\NHe did sound kinda far off.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:17.98,0:18:20.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Where are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:20.11,0:18:23.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm up here! C'mon, guys!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:23.36,0:18:26.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This thing's a blast!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:26.58,0:18:29.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What? Is he nuts?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:29.20,0:18:33.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whee! Awesome!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:33.70,0:18:36.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is awesome!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:36.46,0:18:38.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't do anything stupid!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:38.46,0:18:40.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All our lives depend on this balloon!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:40.42,0:18:42.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You hear me, Luffy?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:42.05,0:18:44.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't worry! Don't worry!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:50.40,0:18:53.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy, stop! Get down!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:53.15,0:18:54.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right now!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:54.23,0:18:56.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji, what are you yelling about?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:56.78,0:18:58.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The octopus is shrinking!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:58.28,0:19:00.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we don't do anything, we'll fall!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:00.30,0:19:01.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:01.43,0:19:03.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:03.30,0:19:04.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's that? Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:04.30,0:19:06.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The octopus is shrinking!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:06.17,0:19:07.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shrinking?!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:07.33,0:19:11.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know, now that I look at it,\Nit does look smaller than it did before.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:11.88,0:19:13.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:13.21,0:19:15.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're still really high up in the air!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:18.18,0:19:19.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Something's wrong!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:19.64,0:19:21.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You've gotta come down now!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:35.23,0:19:36.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That was scary!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:36.48,0:19:38.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wonder why the octopus\Nisn't bouncy anymore.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:38.95,0:19:41.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I told you, it's shrinking, bonehead!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:45.54,0:19:46.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:47.12,0:19:49.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh... That's weird.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:49.08,0:19:51.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How'd the ship get below us?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:56.02,0:19:58.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're gonna hit the sea so hard,\Nwe'll sink to the bottom!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:58.78,0:20:00.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Only if the ship doesn't shatter first!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:00.78,0:20:02.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shatter? No way!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:02.57,0:20:04.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp, what are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:04.74,0:20:06.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What I always do!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:06.07,0:20:07.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Save our lives, of course!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:11.87,0:20:13.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:13.08,0:20:14.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't be crazy, Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.67,0:20:17.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Usopp...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:19.92,0:20:21.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Huh?!\N– Huh?!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:26.47,0:20:29.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Look, it worked!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:29.01,0:20:30.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:30.06,0:20:31.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come on, now.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:31.23,0:20:33.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Breath dials! Do your thing!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:36.36,0:20:38.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now float! Float, I say!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:46.35,0:20:47.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We've slowed down.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:47.69,0:20:49.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:49.02,0:20:50.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are we safe now?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:50.52,0:20:52.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It sure seems like it.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:53.48,0:20:55.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just leave it all up\Nto Usopp to save the day!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:55.90,0:20:58.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp, you're so brave!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:59.74,0:21:01.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I was actually scared\Nthere for a second!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:01.95,0:21:03.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Me, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:03.03,0:21:04.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Looks like we're finally safe!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:07.36,0:21:08.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Or not!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:11.78,0:21:12.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:17.19,0:21:20.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everybody hold onto something!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.25,0:21:34.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Agh! That's cold!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:34.92,0:21:37.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami! Robin! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:37.78,0:21:39.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That was really scary!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:39.74,0:21:41.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What happened to the octopus?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:41.37,0:21:43.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Guess it ran out of air.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:43.12,0:21:44.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wonder how that happened.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:47.67,0:21:49.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:49.63,0:21:53.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't whine.\NWe did make it down here alive!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:53.18,0:21:54.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:57.98,0:22:00.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And we got to see an incredible place.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:01.93,0:22:04.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now that we're down\Nhere, it looks so far away.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:05.57,0:22:07.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Like something out of a dream.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:07.41,0:22:09.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a dreamland.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:09.20,0:22:10.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Think we'll see it again?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:10.91,0:22:13.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, you might see some\Nplace similar when you die.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:13.67,0:22:14.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not you.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:14.79,0:22:16.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I doubt you're going any place good!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:16.85,0:22:18.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You jerk!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:18.18,0:22:20.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You guys keep discussing the afterlife.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:20.52,0:22:22.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Me? I'm gonna go\Nput on a pot of coffee.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:22.77,0:22:24.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Make dinner instead, Sanji!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:24.48,0:22:25.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you ever not hungry?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:25.78,0:22:28.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Have some coffee first\Nand be patient, will ya!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:28.49,0:22:29.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:30.70,0:22:32.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, by the way...
Dialogue: 50,0:22:50.03,0:22:54.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...does anybody know...\Njust where the heck we are?
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=3}===============================DIALOGUE============================
